    "Content": "<p>Easily deploy APIs in a CI/CD pipeline with API Management DevOps Resource Toolkit v1.0.0.&nbsp;The DevOps Resource Toolkit extracts APIs from one service so that they may be applied to another service.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAzure%2Fazure-api-management-devops-resource-kit%2Freleases%2Ftag%2F1.0.0&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cbeenamore%40microsoft.com%7Cdfaab2ee4acb40523fb308da8b7c2850%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637975662645875220%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=D9TIPYVqsNY6IObvDR0KpyanNiXQlwLpdoGc5VLKfzU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the software</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Fapi-management%2Fdevops-api-development-templates&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cbeenamore%40microsoft.com%7Cdfaab2ee4acb40523fb308da8b7c2850%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637975662645875220%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=BYh1JoecWOe5%2F8k96KarKvDBuRZp%2FbLn2ei2fId64ts%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read about CI/CD for API Management</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Easily deploy APIs in a CI/CD pipeline with API Management DevOps Resource Toolkit v1.0.0. The DevOps Resource Toolkit extracts APIs from one service so that they may be applied to another service.\n\nDownload the software .\n\nRead about CI/CD for API Management ."
